                                       "type":  "TextBlock",
                                       "text":  "Root cause",
                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "weight":  "Bolder",
                                       "spacing":  "Medium",
                                       "size":  "Small"
                                   },
                                   {
                                       "type":  "TextBlock",
                                       "text":  "Onboarding load for dealer 63237 (AU423D75, live 2026-09-21) created DEALER_PRODUCT_CODE rows for all 21 program-20285 products but applied rate systems (V_Rate_System_Application) to only 19; AUGP (AU PP GAP) and AUPL (AU PP GAP Plus) have none, so GAP is silently dropped from the 200 SUCCESS response. Only exclusion on AUGP/AUPL in Program_Product_Eligibility is DEMO, so a New/FINANCE deal is eligible. Other WA Audi dealers use AUGP WA / AUPL WA (5 dealers each); both have 24 active RATE_SKU_VCI rows on 2026-09-23, terms 12-96.\n\nQPTR/QPTS: V_PROGRAM_VEHICLE_CLASS carries Make AUDI / Model ALL MODELS / EXCLUDED, eff 2020-01-22 to 9999-12-31. QPVS: every Audi class row is expired; only exclusions remain. QualityProtect is the competitive-make sibling of the VCI line; Audi vehicles are served by AUTR/AUTS/AUVS, which returned. Matches pattern library #23 (partial rate-system sync on onboarding).",
                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "size":  "Small",
                                       "spacing":  "None"
                                   },
                                   {
                                       "type":  "TextBlock",
                                       "text":  "How this was verified",
                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "weight":  "Bolder",
                                       "spacing":  "Medium",
                                       "size":  "Small"
                                   },
                                   {
                                       "type":  "TextBlock",
                                       "text":  "1. GAP rate systems missing - V_Rate_System_Application for Dealer_Number AU423D75 (live EAS, 9/30) returned 19 products; AUGP and AUPL absent.\n2. GAP assigned - live DEALER_PRODUCT_CODE for dealer_id 63237 shows AUGP and AUPL open 2026-09-21 to 9999-12-31.\n3. GAP would price - STAGING.EAS.RATE_SKU_VCI: AUGP WA and AUPL WA each 24 rows active on 2026-09-23, terms 12-96.\n4. WA rate system choice - V_Rate_System_Application program 20285: AUGP WA and AUPL WA each applied to 5 WA dealers.\n5. QP Term excluded - V_PROGRAM_VEHICLE_CLASS QPTR and QPTS: AUDI / ALL MODELS / EXCLUDED, 2020-01-22 to 9999-12-31.\n6. QP VSC no class - V_PROGRAM_VEHICLE_CLASS QPVS Audi rows: all non-exclusion classes expired (latest 2017-01-25).\n7. Payload - 2043636327_provider_combined.txt: single 200 SUCCESS call returning AUMD, QPAP, AUDD, AUTW, AUTH, AUTR, AUTS, AUVS, AUWD, AUKY.\n8. No duplicate - Snowflake contract probe over SG_CON_M1, ECON_CONTRACT and API_CONTRACT_SKU returned 0 rows for the VIN.",
                                       "wrap":  true,
                                       "isSubtle":  true,
                                       "spacing":  "None",
                                       "size":  "Small"
